{"id":"CVE-2008-3143","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"mitre","published":"2008-08-01T14:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-08-07T09:28:41.729Z","description":"Multiple integer overflows in Python before 2.5.2 might allow context-dependent attackers to have an unknown impact via vectors related to (1) Include/pymem.h; (2) _csv.c, (3) _struct.c, (4) arraymodule.c, (5) audioop.c, (6) binascii.c, (7) cPickle.c, (8) cStringIO.c, (9) cjkcodecs/multibytecodec.c, (10) datetimemodule.c, (11) md5.c, (12) rgbimgmodule.c, and (13) stropmodule.c in Modules/; (14) bufferobject.c, (15) listobject.c, and (16) obmalloc.c in Objects/; (17) Parser/node.c; and (18) asdl.c, (19) ast.c, (20) bltinmodule.c, and (21) compile.c in Python/, as addressed by \"checks for integer overflows, contributed by Google.\"","cwe":["n/a"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/495445/100/0/threaded","tags":["mailing-list","x_refsource_BUGTRAQ"],"name":"20080813 rPSA-2008-0243-1 idle python"},{"url":"http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2008-08/msg00006.html","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_SUSE"],"name":"SUSE-SR:2008:017"},{"url":"http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2008/2288","tags":["vdb-entry","x_refsource_VUPEN"],"name":"ADV-2008-2288"},{"url":"http://secunia.com/advisories/32793","tags":["third-party-advisory","x_refsource_SECUNIA"],"name":"32793"},{"url":"http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/30491","tags":["vdb-entry","x_refsource_BID"],"name":"30491"},{"url":"http://svn.python.org/view?rev=60793&view=rev","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://secunia.com/advisories/37471","tags":["third-party-advisory","x_refsource_SECUNIA"],"name":"37471"},{"url":"http://secunia.com/advisories/31687","tags":["third-party-advisory","x_refsource_SECUNIA"],"name":"31687"},{"url":"http://www.python.org/download/releases/2.5.2/NEWS.txt","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://ww